---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import projectRow, noteCard -%}
{%- set L = "ko" -%}
{%- set recentWork = (projects | hasType("work") | limit(3)) -%}
{%- set recentNotes = (collections.notesKo | limit(4)) -%}

<section class="hero" aria-label="소개">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <p class="hero__name">{{ site.name.ko }} · Baehyeon Lim</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title display-font">DEVELOPER</h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">{{ site.tagline.ko }} 지상통제소(GCS)를 Avalonia 크로스플랫폼으로 옮기고, 사내 AI(RAG) 서버를 만들고 있습니다.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a href="/work/" class="btn btn-primary">업무 프로젝트 →</a>
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="btn btn-ghost">포트폴리오</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__scroll-hint"><span class="hero__scroll-line"></span><span class="hero__scroll-text">scroll</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section home-block" aria-labelledby="now-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div><p class="section-label">지금</p><h2 id="now-title" class="section-title display-font">Now</h2></div>
      <a class="section-number mono-font" href="/now/">/now →</a>
    </div>
    <p style="max-width:60ch">사내 AI(RAG) 서버를 구축하고, <a href="/work/bgcs/">BGCS</a>(Avalonia GCS 리뉴얼)를 진행 중입니다.
      배운 것들은 <a href="/notes/">글</a>로 정리하고, 짬짬이 사이드 프로젝트와 독서 기록을 손봅니다.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section home-block" aria-labelledby="home-work">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div><p class="section-label">최근 업무</p><h2 id="home-work" class="section-title display-font">Work</h2></div>
      <a class="section-number mono-font" href="/work/">전체 →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="project-list">
      {%- for p in recentWork -%}{{ projectRow(p, loop.index0, "ko") }}{%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section home-block" aria-labelledby="home-notes">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div><p class="section-label">최근 글</p><h2 id="home-notes" class="section-title display-font">Notes</h2></div>
      <a class="section-number mono-font" href="/notes/">전체 →</a>
    </div>
    {%- if recentNotes.length -%}
    <div class="note-list">
      {%- for n in recentNotes -%}{{ noteCard(n, "ko") }}{%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    {%- else -%}<p class="text-muted">아직 글이 없습니다.</p>{%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
